     "working": "each expiry: C = P, so K* = 100, F = 100, ATM IV = (0.26 + 0.24)/2 = 0.25. Expiries of 20 and 40 days (28800 and 57600 minutes) around N30 = 43200. Cboe weights: (N2 - N30)/(N2 - N1) = 14400/28800 = 0.5 and (N30 - N1)/(N2 - N1) = 0.5. Variance = (T1 s^2 0.5 + T2 s^2 0.5) x N365/N30 with T = N/525600: s^2 x (28800 + 57600)/2 / 525600 x 525600/43200 = s^2 x 43200/43200 = s^2 = 0.0625. sqrt = 0.25"},
